      "document_key": "SSR-B2-001",
      "location": "1.1.1.1 共同業務需求(2)(F) · 轉錄第1頁",
      "page": 1,
      "excerpt": "(F) 催收後，以催收款項_本金佔用額度(非催收款項全部)。\n(3) 針對不同的上階",
      "url": "./index.html?source-document=SSR-B2-001&source-line=20#LN-DOC-SSR-B2-001",
      "verified_at": "2026-10-12",
      "text_sha256": "9c8000177113c4f336b053c48765f6f9446f5429dbede32d0ab8e7f49d6a7b75",
      "excerpt_sha256": "8bac1f9b115abf669de1bb6a90fdef9bb10aac9a56d6eb0cfd88268506d39f1f",
